# Keep the build context small and avoid copying host artifacts that must be
# rebuilt inside the image (esp. node_modules with platform-specific binaries
# and Windows symlinks).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/.env
!**/.env.example
_deploytest
docs/reports/*.pdf
**/*.tsbuildinfo
